.jpg?t=1765536994","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683390/ss_5936c4dc97bca38e858a13d88cac4ebd7089fc43.600x338.jpg?t=1765536994"}],"short_description":"Shifter is a third-person action game where you shift the direction of gravity, fight enemies, and run/fly/fall around a complex procedurally generated dream world. It has unique boss fights, weapons, skills, enemies, and more! Your dream is hacked through a microchip, and you have to wake up.","steam_appid":1683390,"support_info":{"email":"contact@shiftergame.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Finnish, Swedish, German","type":"game","website":"https://iltagames.com/"}